  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/thumbCF.png?raw=true\" alt=\"縮圖\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"標題 Logo\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" width=\"306\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252feldeston\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/eldeston?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&label=@eldeston&color=1DA1F2\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?color=FF0000&logoWidth=16&label=Eldeston&logo=YouTube&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/534748?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=#FFFFFF&label=CurseForge 下載數&color=#FF9101\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/LMIZZNxZ?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=#FFFFFF&label=Modrinth 下載數&color=#00FF00\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>這款光影包旨在呈現已取消的<strong>《超級超級圖形包》</strong>及其他熱門 Minecraft 作品的風格。由<a href=\"https://github.com/Eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston</a>開發，並由<strong>FlameRender Studios</strong>呈現。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>贊助商：BisectHosting</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/sponsor0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"BisectHosting 贊助商\"></a></p>\n<p>本光影包由<strong>BisectHosting</strong>贊助。點擊上方圖片或使用優惠碼<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FLAMERENDERSTUDIOS</strong></a>領取折扣，首月可享<strong>8折優惠</strong>！</p>\n<p>選擇<strong>BisectHosting</strong>來託管各種遊戲，包括我個人最喜愛的<strong>Minecraft、Terraria 和 Project Zomboid</strong>！<strong>首次購買金額的 65%</strong> 將用於支持 Super Duper Vanilla 的開發！</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>影片</h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gaI9rWunhA\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7pNVfX_ywkM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>截圖</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/bd57c68a400e0722bc7132575ea7cec66ca529ab.png\" alt=\"截圖 1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/1d38424b62d4461fae738019cbd1342145e9b4ac.png\" alt=\"截圖 2\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8edcb53225f8eeade023759c54df0916d9e3ff2a.png\" alt=\"截圖 3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/79de640c0254dd1f8ddf44052a79b57105a53f2c.png\" alt=\"截圖 4\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/33a5e8c49e4a386c17a42ef48d96f240fa8e7d20.png\" alt=\"截圖 5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f97e5cb26647bd487fae153b9942f87f373f7695.png\" alt=\"截圖 6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/7735240a7238b15b28dba555abf0cd03f798823a.png\" alt=\"截圖 7\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f643695cdd4ab9f7c95750fb8ff43f396cd16f6c.png\" alt=\"截圖 8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8e152465e03a3861acf4a7be6eca82a86cf26f1a.png\" alt=\"截圖 9\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/0126040f5bcc1828e2de2b059799ab7ffb3d08ec.png\" alt=\"截圖 10\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>本光影包採用<strong>FlameRender (C) Studios 授權條款</strong>。更多詳情請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252f127.0.0.1%253a3000%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a>。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>版本相容性</h2>\n<p>版本相容性因兩種知名光影載入器 Iris 與 Optifine 而有所不同。Minecraft 1.18.2 以上的 Iris 1.6.10+ 版本與本光影包相容。對於 Optifine，則取決於 GPU 廠商。請務必選擇您對應 Minecraft 版本的最新 Iris 或 Optifine。</p>\n<p><strong>自本光影包 1.3.7 版本起，將不再優先支援或維護 Optifine。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Iris</th>\n<th>Windows、Linux（Intel、AMD、NVidia）</th>\n<th>Apple（M1）</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.18.2+</td>\n<td>支援</td>\n<td>支援</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1-</td>\n<td>不支援</td>\n<td>不支援</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Optifine</th>\n<th>Windows、Linux（Intel、AMD、NVidia）</th>\n<th>Apple（M1）</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1+</td>\n<td>部分支援</td>\n<td>部分支援</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.14.2+</td>\n<td>部分支援</td>\n<td>不支援</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.13.2-</td>\n<td>不支援</td>\n<td>不支援</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>官方 Modrinth 頁面</h2>\n<p>Super Duper Vanilla 剛好也在 Modrinth 上！穩定版與最新版本都會在那裡提供。點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fsuper-duper-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>查看，並使用其中的任一連結下載以支持我！</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>社群連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器，與我們的工作室社群一起討論其他開發項目！<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flamerender Studios Discord</a></li>\n<li>或者在 Twitter 上關注我，或訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道，以獲取最新的開發動態與內容<br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston 的 Twitter</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?view_as=subscriber\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston 的頻道</a></li>\n<li>您可以透過上述任一方式成為支持者，或透過 PayPal 捐款<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%253fhosted_button_id%253d4XLQ4WE296JKW\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal 捐款</a></li>\n</ul>",
